    <p>
      <b>Description</b>
    </p>
    <p>3D scope for plotting three time-series components. Includes rotation parameters for 3D view.</p>
    <p>
      <b>Ports</b>
    </p>
    <p>
      <b>Input(s)</b>
    </p>
    <table border="1">
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>Port</th>
          <th>Role</th>
          <th>Side</th>
          <th>Position</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr>
          <td>Port_1</td>
          <td>Numeric signal read by the block.</td>
          <td>left</td>
          <td>x=0, y=50</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Port_2</td>
          <td>Numeric signal read by the block.</td>
          <td>left</td>
          <td>x=0, y=90</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Port_3</td>
          <td>Numeric signal read by the block.</td>
          <td>left</td>
          <td>x=0, y=130</td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
