    <p>
      <b>Algorithms</b>
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>INIT clears xSeries, ySeries, and zSeries.</li>
      <li>AFTER_STEP appends the three inputs; missing inputs append NaN.</li>
      <li>The block has no outputs.</li>
    </ul>
